s=s.replace('{int period=1;if(r%period==0){int slot=(r/period)%64;uint64_t bit=1ULL<<slot;for(int k=0;k<int(papers.size());k++)future[k]=(future[k]&~bit)|(selected[k]?bit:0ULL);}}', '{int word=product/64;uint64_t bit=1ULL<<(product%64);for(int k=0;k<int(papers.size());k++)future[k][word]=(future[k][word]&~bit)|(selected[k]?bit:0ULL);}')
